				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://itgonglun.wordpress.com/?p=6136</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[二零二四年，本站刊「喬布斯的孩子用 iPad 嗎？」一文。日前 David Streitfeld 爲《紐約時報 [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>二零二四年，本站刊「<a href="https://blog.yitianshijie.net/2024/05/06/do-steve-jobs-kids-use-ipad/">喬布斯的孩子用 iPad 嗎？</a>」一文。日前 David Streitfeld 爲《紐約時報》<a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/18/technology/silicon-valley-tech-fans-children.html">撰文</a>，談 Mark Zuckerberg、Peter Thiel、Steve Chen 等人爲子女擋道。評論區 Shelley 述九十年代與 Alan Kay 的<a href="https://www.nytimes.com/shared/comment/4ib576?rsrc=cshare&amp;smid=url-share">問答</a>：</p>
<p>——何種電腦軟件最具教育意義？家有兩歲幼女，應購何者？</p>
<p>答：推延方爲正道。踩水窪、玩泥巴、抱公仔。電腦這種事不用急。</p>
<p>#AlanSaidItThirtyYearsAgo</p>
<p>（<a href="https://yitianshijie.vercel.app/2026/10/27/6136">點此</a>讀竪排版）</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
